# Commit Messages

- Do not use `NOJIRA` or any placeholder ticket in commit messages.
- If the user provides a Jira ticket, include that exact ticket.
- If no Jira ticket is provided, omit the ticket instead of inventing one.
- Start commit messages with an uppercase letter.
- Keep commit messages concise and focused on the change.
